Task 1: Word Builder

Code

```js
function wordBuilder(array) { 
    let collection = [];

    for (let i = 0; i < array.length; i++) { 
        for (let j = 0; j < array.length; j++) {
            if (i !== j) {
                collection.push(array[i] + array[j]);
            }
        }
    }

    return collection; 
}

  Space Complexity

The function creates many word combinations and stores them in a new array. Since nested loops are used, the amount of memory grows very quickly as the input size increases.

**Big O Space Complexity: O(n²)**



